<title>USA: Tandy Brands Accessories CFO resigns.</title>
<headline>Tandy Brands Accessories CFO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON, Texas 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tandy Brands Accessories Inc said Monday that Bruce Cole has announced his resignation as vice president and chief financial officer to pursue other business interests.  </p>
<p>A statement from the company did not say what it plans to do to replace Cole and no one from the company was immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>Tandy manufactures and markets men's, ladies' and children's fashion accessories and neckwear.</p>
